# ── Build artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every archive here is produced by a script, never hand-edited:
#   kohandezhcv.zip   — rebuilt by _tooling/wp-theme/sync-from-static.py
#   kohan-avatar.zip  — rebuilt from the plugin source beside it
# Tracking them means a 24 MB binary diff on every sync, for a file anyone
# can regenerate in one command.
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# ── Local tool state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Browse logs, a memory database and per-run scratch from the local AI
# tooling. Machine-specific, and the network logs record URLs visited.
.tooling-state/

# QA run output: audit logs, one-off check scripts and ~3 MB of before/after
# screenshots. Evidence from a past session, not something a clone needs to
# build or run the site.
.gstack/

# ── Server / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
error_log
node_modules/

# ── Scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tmp-blog-import/
*.log
